, so tracker export could claim every connection in the pool it\nshares with Hibernate, login and every other product (DHIS2-20655).\n\nIt is a deadlock bound, not only a fairness one. The enrollment branch holds two\nconnections at once, so Cm = 2 and pool_size \u003e= Tn + 1, which an unbounded Tn\ncannot satisfy at any pool size.\n\nReplaces the static pool with a bounded ThreadPoolTaskExecutor bean sized from\nconnection.pool.max_size, so lowering the pool cannot leave the cap oversized.\nOverflow uses CallerRunsPolicy, serialising a branch onto the request thread\nrather than failing the export.","author":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"},"id":"07ab35f983df02dcf366166dca887f275c6ca23a","tree_id":"221f8d6f7ab769a86760d1ed773d781fea5c40fa","timestamp":"2026-09-02T13:19:27Z","committer":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core",